          "end": 3.726,
          "text": "Early expert systems followed rules written by people."
        },
        {
          "start": 3.676,
          "end": 7.169,
          "text": "Machine learning later found patterns in examples."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.169,
          "end": 15.196,
          "text": "Deep learning used multilayer neural networks to learn richer features, while the Transformer became a foundation for modern language models."
