        {
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 8.445,
          "text": "This lesson illustrates one common vision-transformer approach: divide an image into patches and form computable visual representations."
        },
        {
          "start": 8.395,
          "end": 11.998,
          "text": "Not every multimodal model uses this architecture."
        },
        {
          "start": 11.998,
          "end": 17.23,
          "text": "Patch size is usually an architecture setting, not a universal user control."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
