        {
          "start": 3.873,
          "end": 11.091,
          "text": "Diffusion generation instead starts with noise and progressively denoises under conditioning, sometimes in latent space."
        },
        {
          "start": 11.091,
          "end": 16.115,
          "text": "This is a common method, not the only algorithm used by every image tool."
