          "start": 3.37,
          "end": 7.61,
          "text": "Workflows run predefined steps, branches, and loops."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.61,
          "end": 11.74,
          "text": "Agents can choose later actions toward a goal based on results."
        },
        {
          "start": 11.74,
